<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title><%= state === 'notfound' ? 'Kode tidak ditemukan' : 'Belum diaktifkan' %></title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@500;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  :root{
    --paper:#EDEAE1; --paper-alt:#E3DFD3; --ink:#1C2321; --ink-soft:#5B6460;
    --line:#C9C2B4; --stamp-red:#B3392F; --brass:#A6784A;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{
    margin:0; min-height:100vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 10% 10%, #00000006 0, transparent 40%),
      radial-gradient(circle at 90% 90%, #00000006 0, transparent 40%),
      var(--paper);
    font-family:'Inter', sans-serif; color:var(--ink); padding:24px;
  }
  .card{
    max-width:420px; width:100%; background:var(--paper-alt);
    border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:2px; padding:40px 32px;
    text-align:center; position:relative;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 0 #fff inset, 0 18px 40px -20px rgba(28,35,33,0.35);
  }
  .card::before{
    content:""; position:absolute; inset:8px; border:1px dashed var(--line); pointer-events:none;
  }
  .stamp{
    display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;
    width:96px; height:96px; border-radius:50%; border:3px solid var(--stamp-red);
    color:var(--stamp-red); font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:700;
    font-size:13px; letter-spacing:0.08em; transform:rotate(-9deg); margin-bottom:22px;
    text-align:center; line-height:1.25; opacity:0.9;
  }
  .stamp.notfound{ border-color:var(--ink-soft); color:var(--ink-soft); }
  h1{
    font-family:'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; font-size:22px; margin:0 0 10px;
    letter-spacing:-0.01em;
  }
  p{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.6; margin:0 0 24px; }
  .code-tag{
    display:inline-block; font-family:'JetBrains Mono', monospace; font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:0.04em; font-size:13px; background:var(--paper); border:1px solid var(--line);
    padding:8px 14px; border-radius:2px; color:var(--ink);
  }
  .foot{ margin-top:26px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); letter-spacing:0.03em; text-transform:uppercase; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <% if (state === 'notfound') { %>
      <div class="stamp notfound">TIDAK<br/>DITEMUKAN</div>
      <h1>Kode tidak dikenali</h1>
      <p>Kode ini tidak terdaftar di sistem kami. Pastikan Anda memindai kode asli dari lokasi kami, atau hubungi petugas di tempat.</p>
    <% } else { %>
      <div class="stamp">BELUM<br/>AKTIF</div>
      <h1>Kode ini belum diaktifkan</h1>
      <p>Tautan ulasan untuk kode ini belum dipasang oleh admin. Coba pindai lagi dalam beberapa saat, atau tanyakan ke petugas di tempat.</p>
    <% } %>
    <div class="code-tag"><%= code %></div>
    <div class="foot">Sistem Kode Ulasan</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
